        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 98C2004/30, 98C Series Traditional Steeped Rose 30\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic styling of the steeped mounts on Deltana's 98C2004/30 towel bar makes it great for any traditional setting. The 30\" length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made out of solid brass, it is available in oil rubbed bronze, polished chrome, and satin nickel finishes. This 98C series towel bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-98C2004_30-specifications.gif?v=1704442276\" width=\"600\" height=\"149\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 98C2004/30 30\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-classic-towel-bar-deltana-98c2002-18\"><b>18\" 98C Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-classic-towel-bar-deltana-98c2003-24\"><b>24\" 98C Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=382603\"><b>Deltana 98C Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 98C Solid Brass 30\" Classic Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bar Length center to center: 29-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 32-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-98C2004_30.pdf?v=1691095379\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 98C2004/30 30\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
